cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Trivikrama, please cite it as below."
title: "Trivikrama: streaming full-size transformer encoders on microcontrollers"
abstract: >-
  An open-source C library and converter that runs pretrained transformer
  encoders on microcontrollers by streaming int8 weights from external storage
  one tile at a time, so each weight is read once per inference.
authors:
  - family-names: "Sai Charan"
    given-names: "Vadhyar"
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-17"
repository-code: "https://github.com/charanvadhyar/trivikrama"
keywords:
  - tinyml
  - microcontroller
  - transformer
  - bert
  - out-of-core inference
  - esp32
  - rp2040
